WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.686 --> 00:00:01.830
Narrator: Same fan.

2
00:00:02.173 --> 00:00:03.317
Narrator: Now watch Noura.

3
00:00:03.546 --> 00:00:07.434
Narrator: She stands to the side, out of reach, hands open.

4
00:00:07.777 --> 00:00:08.921
Narrator: She listens first.

5
00:00:09.264 --> 00:00:10.865
Narrator: She shows she understands.

6
00:00:11.208 --> 00:00:17.041
Noura: I understand - your cousin is inside and you don't want to miss kick-off.

7
00:00:17.385 --> 00:00:19.329
Narrator: She asks a useful question.

8
00:00:19.558 --> 00:00:23.446
Noura: Can you call him? Is the ticket on his phone?

9
00:00:23.789 --> 00:00:30.766
Narrator: And she proposes a plan - step out of the queue, call your cousin, I'll ask my supervisor.


10
00:00:31.938 --> 00:00:40.045
Noura: Let's step out of the queue to this side. You call your cousin, and I'll ask my supervisor what we can do.

11
00:00:40.245 --> 00:00:43.348
Narrator: Notice she never says no entry - or calm down.

12
00:00:43.548 --> 00:00:46.651
Narrator: The fan has options, and the queue moves again.

